# Restless Vents enters tapped on turn 1 and is a plain land. On turn 3 Bot1 pays {1}{B}{R} with three Moxen and animates it: until end
# of turn it is a 2/3 black and red Insect land creature with menace (CR 613.1d, 613.4b). It attacks beside an Elvish Mystic. Bot2's lone
# Llanowar Elves may block the ground attacker but not the Vents, which has menace (the refusal beside its control: the same Elves do block
# the Mystic). Attacking triggers the loot: Bot1 discards a Plains and draws a card (one Plains in hand either side of it), and the Vents deals 2
# unblocked while the Mystic trades with the Elves. On turn 4 the effect is gone: it is only a Land again.

